      "content": "thanks for that. i noticed u mentioned africa needing more \"hands-on management\" to meet deadlines compared to the others. can u dig a bit deeper into why that is? like, is there a cultural or structural reason why workers there might be less reliable with tight schedules or harder to manage than, say, people in eastern europe or se asia? just trying to understand the specific risk factors.",
